```
- Add `BuildInfo` field to `ControlState`/`Dispatcher` with `unknown` defaults
- Each binary (`limux-cli`, `limux-host-linux`, `limux-control-server`) reads its own `env!("LIMUX_BUILD_SHA")` etc. and injects into `BuildInfo` before serving `system.identify`
- `system.identify` response gains additive `build` object with same shape on both paths (standalone dispatcher in `rust/limux-core/src/lib.rs` and GTK bridge in `rust/limux-host-linux/src/control_bridge.rs`)

**3. --version flag in limux-cli**
- Add `"--version"` arm to the hand-rolled string-match parser in `rust/limux-cli/src/main.rs` (NOT extending existing version plumbing — this is a NEW flag)
- Output: `limux-cli {crate_version} ({short_sha}, {profile}) install-id={install_id} channel={channel}`
- Read `install-info.json` at runtime relative to `current_exe()` (walk up ≤3 levels to find `install-info.json` next to install root)
- Absent file → omit install-id/channel fields, no error
- Malformed file → omit fields (doctor will warn)

**4. Host start-line + panic hook in limux-host-linux**
